<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Deadline Missed - Extension Option</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #dc3545; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .alert { background: #f8d7da; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .option { background: #d1ecf1; border: 1px solid #bee5eb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>⏰ Deadline Missed</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Translation Deadline Missed</h2>
            
            <div class="alert">
                <strong>❌ DEADLINE MISSED:</strong> Your translation request deadline has passed.
            </div>
            
            <h3>Request Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{request.id}}</li>
                <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{request.description}}</li>
                <li><strong>Deadline:</strong> {{request.deadline}}</li>
                <li><strong>Current Progress:</strong> {{percentage}}%</li>
            </ul>
            
            <div class="option">
                <strong>🔄 EXTENSION OPTION:</strong> You have 3 days to request a deadline extension.
                <br><strong>Extension Deadline:</strong> {{extensionDeadline}}
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>Action Required:</strong> You must request an extension within 3 days to continue working on this request.</p>
            
            <p><strong>To Request Extension:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Log into your account</li>
                <li>Go to the request details</li>
                <li>Click "Request Extension"</li>
                <li>Provide a reason and requested days</li>
            </ol>
            
            <p><strong>Warning:</strong> If no extension is requested within 3 days, the request will be marked as failed and your deposit will be refunded to the requester.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from HereToTranslate</p>
            <p>Please do not reply to this email</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
